<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Patch Up?</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{
height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#4c1d95);
overflow:hidden;
}

body::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
width:100%;
height:100%;
background:
radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%,rgba(255,255,255,.15) 2px,transparent 3px),
radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%,rgba(255,255,255,.15) 2px,transparent 3px),
radial-gradient(circle at 30% 80%,rgba(255,255,255,.15) 2px,transparent 3px),
radial-gradient(circle at 70% 70%,rgba(255,255,255,.15) 2px,transparent 3px);
background-size:220px 220px;
animation:move 15s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes move{
0%{transform:translateY(0);}
100%{transform:translateY(-220px);}
}

.container{
position:relative;
z-index:10;
width:1200px;
height:680px;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
padding:40px;
}

h1{
color:white;
font-size:42px;
margin-bottom:35px;
}

p{
width:900px;
color:white;
font-size:22px;
line-height:1.8;
}

.buttons{
margin-top:60px;
display:flex;
gap:40px;
}

button{
padding:16px 50px;
font-size:22px;
border:none;
border-radius:50px;
font-weight:bold;
cursor:pointer;
transition:.3s;
}

.yes{
background:white;
color:#4c1d95;
}

.no{
background:#ff4d6d;
color:white;
}

button:hover{
transform:scale(1.08);
}

@media(max-width:900px){

.container{
width:95%;
height:auto;
}

h1{
font-size:28px;
}

p{
width:95%;
font-size:17px;
}

.buttons{
flex-direction:column;
gap:20px;
}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<h1>Kidddoo... ❤️</h1>

<p>

Idk what happened. Neither you cleared it nor do I know what actually happened.

The onlyyy thing I know is that I stilll misss youu a lottt.

I am still waiting...

Neverthelesss I wannnaaa sayyy ki forget whatever happened in the past.

Umm... Plss Comebackk naaa... 😭

<br><br>

<b>"Abbb Tere Bina Dill Nhi Lagta..."</b>

<br><br>

Our late night talks...

Late Night VC...

Our random laughs...

Everything...

I miss all of it.

Every single day I wish things could become the way they were before.

Please give us one more chance.

</p>

<div class="buttons">

<button class="yes"
onclick="location.href='page8.html'">
Yes
</button>

<button class="no"
onclick="location.href='page5.html'">
No
</button>

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
